  every card in all 77 frames: ordinary 85 is a 1px border, selected 87 is a
  2px border reaching one pixel further on each edge, and a surviving 1.5px
  border would have measured 86, which nothing does.

  AND: a picker shows three rows. There are 24 languages and more regions than
  that, so how 24 become 3 - a scroll, a page, a search - is NOT in this
  capture and is not decided by it.
-->

